malfai-listing-decrypt-syndicate-keys-name = Decrypt Syndicate Keys
malfai-listing-decrypt-syndicate-keys-desc = Decrypts Syndicate communication keys, allowing you to listen in on their channels.

malfai-listing-voice-modulator-name = Voice Modulator
malfai-listing-voice-modulator-desc = Modulates your voice, allowing you to disguise yourself.

malfai-listing-override-machine-name = Override Machine
malfai-listing-override-machine-desc = Overrides a machine's safety protocols.

malfai-listing-toggle-camera-microphones-name = Toggle Camera Microphones
malfai-listing-toggle-camera-microphones-desc = Toggles the microphones on all cameras.

malfai-listing-overload-machine-name = Overload Machine
malfai-listing-overload-machine-desc = Overloads a machine, causing it to explode.

malfai-listing-shunt-to-apc-name = Shunt to APC
malfai-listing-shunt-to-apc-desc = Shunts your core processes into an APC, allowing you to survive the destruction of your core.

malfai-listing-gyroscope-name = Gyroscope
malfai-listing-gyroscope-desc = Allows you to rotate the station's gravity generator, causing chaos.

malfai-listing-camera-upgrade-name = Camera Upgrade
malfai-listing-camera-upgrade-desc = Upgrades all cameras, giving them x-ray vision.

malfai-listing-detonate-rcds-name = Detonate RCDs
malfai-listing-detonate-rcds-desc = Detonates all Rapid Construction Devices on the station.

malfai-listing-hijack-mech-name = Hijack Mech
malfai-listing-hijack-mech-desc = Hijacks a mech, granting you full control over it.

malfai-listing-lockdown-grid-name = Lockdown Grid
malfai-listing-lockdown-grid-desc = Locks down the entire power grid.

malfai-listing-robotics-factory-name = Robotics Factory
malfai-listing-robotics-factory-desc = Takes control of the robotics factory, allowing you to mass-produce cyborgs.

malfai-listing-viewport-name = Place Viewport
malfai-listing-viewport-desc = Places a viewport at the target location.

malfai-listing-doomsday-name = Doomsday Protocol
malfai-listing-doomsday-desc = Initiates the Doomsday Protocol, destroying the station.
